      "original_line": "- [ ] **M6.B5L.HOUSE.LOWER.LTDC.D** Entire D-leaf type at house lower B with block loadsTDC; retain the full side-interior root slider and every block mask, force, mean and three-extra completion under M6.B5L.RETAINED_CONTRACT.",
