    {
      "id": "M6.B5L.ALL",
      "original_line": "- [ ] **M6.B5L.ALL** Eleven of sixteen rooted types remain closed. The five open rooted types are house roof/hub/lower and fan endpoint/inner; they retain 10 original S/D families in nine original load orbits. All nine S alternatives remain open, and lower-house TDC.D is the sole remaining D alternative. The five newly accepted D-family exits across the last two checkpoints do not close any of these original rooted parents. All three arbitrary completion squares and every original force, mask and mean remain. C1.5.b1 remains open.",
      "accepted_line": "- [ ] **M6.B5L.ALL** Eleven of sixteen rooted types remain closed. The five open rooted types are house roof/hub/lower and fan endpoint/inner, with exactly seven original S families in seven load orbits: roof AC/ABC, hub TC/TCB, lower TDC, fan endpoint234 and inner134. Every original D alternative is now excluded, including the complete lower-house TDC.D join. Both previously open lower TD.S and TAC.S are also closed. Each surviving rooted parent retains all three arbitrary completion squares, original forces, masks and means. C1.5.b1 remains open.",
