      "accepted_line": "- [ ] **G3.M6.ASSEMBLE** All original six-body parents except C1.5.b1 and C1.6.b0 are closed at the declared hand-proof prerequisite scope. Finish the seven house/fan S families, remaining chorded-hexagon domains and two H4_D0 inner-pentagon masks with all three actual completion squares. The complete H2_D0 and H3 no-chord graphs are closed. No partial owner interface closes a remaining parent.",
